beeline — Beeline Cloud PBX calls in a local store: transcribe them on this computer, then read and
search offline.

Usage: beeline <profile> <command> [options]
Account commands start with your profile, a name you choose; none is ever assumed.

What you can do:
  meetings sync                       copy the recorded calls since the last sync
  meetings transcribe                 turn new calls into manager and client dialogues, locally
  meetings list "duration_ms>=60000"  the calls of a minute or more, newest first
  meetings transcript <meeting>       one call as a dialogue
  mcp serve                           the calls for an agent, within the profile's permissions

Works with:
  tg                                  Telegram in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  max                                 MAX in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  wa                                  WhatsApp in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  zm                                  Zoom meetings: transcripts and summaries, searchable with your other WireCat data
  drive                               Google Drive and Docs as local text, searchable with your other WireCat data
  gcal                                Google Calendar events, searchable with your other WireCat data
  memo context <person>               one person across messengers, mail, notes and meetings
  mail                                IMAP mail in the same local store: search your mailbox offline, next to your other WireCat data
  b24                                 Bitrix24 CRM: deals, leads and pipelines, searchable with your other WireCat data

Start here:   beeline work session start  (any profile name works)
Next:         beeline commands            every command, by section
              beeline guide               scenarios: command sequences for common tasks
              beeline help options        output, offline, timeouts, dry run
For agents:   beeline skill show          rules and the discovery loop
